ic fractures of the femur</article-title><source>J Orthop Trauma</source><year>2001</year><volume>15</volume><fpage>394</fpage><lpage>400</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11514765</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1097/00005131-200108000-00003</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B15"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Bess</surname><given-names>RJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Jolly</surname><given-names>SA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Comparison of compression hip screw and gamma nail for treatment of peritrochanteric fractures</article-title><source>J South Orthop Assoc</source><year>1997</year><volume>6</volume><fpage>173</fpage><lpage>179</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9322196</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B16"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Parker</surname><given-names>MJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Handoll</surname><given-names>HH</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Gamma and other cephalocondylic intramedullary nails versus extramedullary implants for extracapsular hip fractures</article-title><source>Cochrane Database Syst Rev</source><year>2008</year><volume>3</volume><fpage>CD000093</fpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18646058</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B17"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Valverde</surname><given-names>JA</given-names></name><name><surname>Alonso</surname><given-names>MG</given-names></name><name><surname>Porro</surname><given-names>JG</given-names></name><name><surname>Rueda</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Larrauri</surname><given-names>PM</given-names></name><name><surname>Soler</surname><given-names>JJ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Use of the Gamma nail in the treatment of fractures of the proximal femur</article-title><source>Clin Orthop</source><year>1998</year><volume>350</volume><fpage>56</fpage><lpage>61</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9602800</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B18"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Rosenblum</surname><given-names>SF</given-names></name><name><surname>Zuckerman</surname><given-names>JD</given-names></name><name><surname>Kummer</surname><given-names>FJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Tam</surname><given-names>BS</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>A biomechanical evaluation of the Gamma nail</article-title><source>J Bone Joint Surg Br</source><year>1992</year><volume>74</volume><fpage>352</fpage><lpage>357</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">1587875</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B19"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Bridle</surname><given-names>SH</given-names></name><name><surname>Patel</surname><given-names>AD</given-names></name><name><surname>Bircher</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Calvert</surname><given-names>PT</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Fixation of intertrochanteric fractures of the femur: a randomised prospective comparison of the gamma nail and the dynamic hip screw</article-title><source>J Bone Joint Surg Br</source><year>1991</year><volume>73</volume><fpage>330</fpage><lpage>334</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">2005167</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B20"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Wang</surname><given-names>CJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Brown</surname><given-names>CJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Yettram</surname><given-names>AL</given-names></name><name><surname>Procter</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Intramedullary femoral nails: one or two lag screws? A preliminary study</article-title><source>Med Eng Phys</source><year>2000</year><volume>22</volume><fpage>613</fpage><lp